  "result": "Perfect! All 382 tests pass \u2713\n\n**Enhanced renderInvoiceText() in src/render.js:**\n\nNow displays:\n1. **Invoice number or DRAFT** - for identification\n2. **Customer ID** - who the invoice is for\n3. **Line items** - quantity, name, unit price, and total\n4. **Line discounts** (new) - shows discount amount for each line that has one\n   - Indented with 2 spaces for clarity\n   - Only shown when discount > 0\n5. **Voucher** (new) - displays voucher amount if applied\n   - Positioned before VAT/Total for clarity\n6. **VAT** - total tax amount\n7. **Total** - invoice total\n8. **Due date** (new) - when invoice has a dueDate\n   - Format: \"Due: YYYY-MM-DD\"\n9. **Paid amount** (new) - when invoice has payments\n   - Shows sum of all payments received\n   - Format: \"Paid: \u20acX,XXX.XX\"\n\n**Example output:**\n```\nINV-2026-0001\nC-001\n2 x Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac170.00\n  Discount: \u20ac17.00\n5 x Icon set (24 icons) @ \u20ac9.80 = \u20ac49.00\n  Discount: \u20ac2.45\nVoucher: \u20ac10.00\nVAT: \u20ac41.91\nTotal: \u20ac231.46\nDue: 2026-10-21\nPaid: \u20ac30.00\n```\n\n**Added 16 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Line discount display and formatting\n- Voucher display and positioning\n- Due date display with proper format\n- Payment display with sum of multiple payments\n- Correct line ordering of all elements\n- Edge cases (no discounts, no vouchers, no payments)\n- Complete invoice with all features combined\n- Bulk discount display on high-quantity items",
